      "old_text": "$\\mathfrak p \\subset R$ is a prime, then we see each\n$R_{f_i}/\\mathfrak pR_{f_i} = (R/\\mathfrak p)_{f_i}$ is N-2\nand hence we conclude $R/\\mathfrak p$ is N-2 by\nLemma \\ref{lemma-Japanese-local}. This proves (2).",
