      "replacement_text": "$a_{i, j} \\in R/\\mathfrak p$. After further replacing each $x_i$\nby $g x_i$, we may assume\n$a_{i, j} \\in \\mathfrak m/\\mathfrak p \\subset R/\\mathfrak p$ for all $i, j$.",
      "source_end_line": 46051,
