      "old_text": "Moreover, $S'$ is finite over $S$. If for every maximal ideal\n$\\mathfrak m'$ of $S'$ the local ring $S'_{\\mathfrak m'}$ is\nN-1, then $S'_{\\mathfrak m}$ is N-1 by",
