      "replacement_sha256": "7F500499DF91984A2CE889C2CC7A25836B8CB653F34B0DCA8B9826B244865AA0",
      "replacement_text": "We have to show $S_{\\mathfrak m}$ is N-1. If $x = 0$, then $S = R$\nand there is nothing to prove. Thus we may and do assume $x \\not = 0$.",
